# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Five-Year Strategic Plan (2025-2029)
**Document ID**: STRAT-002
**Classification**: Internal - Confidential
**Board Approved**: December 2024

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync is positioned to become the leading care coordination platform in healthcare. This five-year plan outlines our path from $168M ARR to $900M ARR, expanding from US healthcare to global markets, and from point solution to platform.

